        "original_id": "e2e63aa9-3765-50b6-a026-ae5ca72f9f78",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Charlie Rowe, Octavia Spencer, Dave Annable, Philip Pullman, Alastair Paton, Jodelle Ferland, Li Bingbing, Maria Valverde\n- Works: Never Let Me Go, The Boat That Rocked, The Golden Compass, Neverland, Red Band Society, Northern Lights, His Dark Materials, 400 Boys\n- Organizations: Fox, SyFy, Sky Movies\n- Topics: Film and television roles, Adaptations\n\nFacts:\n- Charlie Rowe played Billy Costa in The Golden Compass.\n- The Golden Compass is a 2007 British-American fantasy adventure film.\n- The Golden Compass is based on Northern Lights, the first novel in Philip Pullman's His Dark Materials trilogy.\n- Charlie Rowe's film roles include Young Tommy in Never Let Me Go and James in The Boat That Rocked.\n- Charlie Rowe played Peter in Neverland, a Peter Pan prequel from SyFy and Sky Movies.\n- Charlie Rowe later played Leo Roth on Fox's medical comedy-drama series Red Band Society alongside Octavia Spencer and Dave Annable.\n- 400 Boys is a Canadian-Chinese action-fantasy thriller film.\n- 400 Boys was directed, written, and produced by Alastair Paton.\n- 400 Boys stars Jodelle Ferland, Li Bingbing, Maria Valverde, and Charlie Rowe.",
